<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62081" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαῦσαι:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιππεῦσαι τοῖς δεσπόταις</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαυστήρ:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μοχθηρός, ὅμοιον δὲ τῇ δυνάμει τὸ ὄνομα,
			ἢ οἴκου λαύρα</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαύστρανον:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὲς λύκον, τινὲς φρέατος ἅρπαγα</span>,
		Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαυφθάζει:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπεύδει</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαυφθάσσει:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάβρως ἐσθίει</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαυχάνη:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλῶσσα</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάφατον</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάπαθον</span>
			, <u>Gloss.</u>
        </div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
